  "notes": [
    "The pinned ReOrg 3.1 release supplies the stock ReOrg.brain 1.04, ReOrg.asc, the original ReOrg.prefs and the three English documents.",
    "Holger Kruse’s published 3.11 patch applied to the 3.1 archive member yields the exact stock executable. The manifest uses the checked BCWB executable so distribution builds can run directly on the host.",
    "Four checked BCWB input icons retain stock artwork, positions and tooltypes. BCWB puts the English guide beside the executable. The stock installer copies the files through its ordinary payload copy."
